  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f03-future-distance" name="From the next use to a conservative deadline" ecgTitle="From the next use to a conservative deadline" ecgDescription="The checked property-line use at sequence 19 is followed by a use at sequence 23. Distance four is represented by token four and decoded distance seven, producing deadline 26. Holding this prediction fixed, it becomes unknown at sequence 27, never dead. Separate panels explain bucket precision and traversal-wrap semantics.">
